WEBVTT

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.250
Who are you?

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.080
I'm Nina!

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:17.960
Do you know of a child
with two different colored eyes?

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.420
Yeah, Favaro wasn't exactly trustworthy.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.640
-Favaro?
-Favaro?

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.350
Where is Azazel?

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.890
If I don't do something, Azazel will be killed!

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.520
Azazel! You can't die!

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.310
We finally meet,

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.110
Rag Demon!

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.650
Rage of Bahamut

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.100
-Search the rubble.
-Yes, sir.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.060
Wait.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:41.170
So the Rag Demon was you.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:46.380
Charioce!

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.390
What's wrong? Are you finished already?

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:50.860
Charioce!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.830
Hey, Nina!

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:04.960
Nina, the evacuation site's the other way!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.790
Hey!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:10.170
Tonight,

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:13.800
The king is planning to end things with the Rag Demon
once and for all!

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:18.470
He'll be waiting in the center of the city
with demon hostages.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.470
Mugaro?

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.900
Mugaro, what are you doing here?

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.460
What was that?

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:51.750
Azazel!

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:04.480
Mugaro, I told you not to come.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:12.530
You, take Mugaro and go far away from here.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.150
What about you?

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.240
Wait!

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.250
-Move!
-No!

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:26.500
If you fight with those injuries,

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.330
you really will get yourself killed!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.500
I'm going

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.920
even if it kills me.

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.300
You can't!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.420
Rag Demon!

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:37.970
Can you hear me?

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.430
If you do not show yourself,

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:42.930
I will slaughter all of these demons.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.890
That is the king of men,

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:46.430
Charioce.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.350
What kind of king would do this?

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.690
If I die,

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.820
use your power for the demons.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.610
Don't!

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.870
Get a hold of yourself!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.330
Wait!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:13.340
I'll tell you the truth.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.760
Promise you won't tell anyone else!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.020
Hug me!

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:28.890
What are you saying?

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.140
Hurry up!

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:31.900
Hug me!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.260
So this is...

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.100
...the red dragon.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.640
Incredible.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.190
What's wrong? Attack me!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.000
Kaisar?

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:36.230
Fire! Save our king and the captain!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.200
Draw the dragon's attention to us!

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.050
Pull back!

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.340
My Lord, now!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.640
Nina!

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:04.400
You know, it's thanks to this girl

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:07.190
that you're still breathing.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:08.740
I know.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.700
Her dragon

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:16.450
is like a small Bahamut.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:29.800
Rage of Bahamut

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:33.760
I would have lost my life if it weren't for you.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:34.930
You have my thanks.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.890
I'm not worthy of such words.

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:41.600
I only did what any knight would do.

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:44.110
A knight, you say?

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:47.230
Then I ask you as a knight, Kaisar:

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:51.820
what is your relation to the Rag Demon?

00:11:55.950 --> 00:12:01.120
I already know that you and the Rag Demon
are connected.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:04.460
Are you his ally?

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:05.960
Confess everything.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.090
If you do not, I will kill you here.

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:13.140
My Lord.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.800
That demon,

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:17.810
Azazel, is the demon who killed my father.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:29.820
If you knew this,
why did you not kill him immediately?

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:33.160
The Rag Demon had someone with him.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:34.780
Not I, but...

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.660
the red dragon.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:42.040
Yes, My Lord.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:46.380
The dragon's power is even greater
than the Rag Demon's.

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:48.380
And that is why you let him go?

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:49.590
Yes, My Lord.

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:54.760
Considering the history we had,
I thought I could contact the Rag Demon.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:58.760
I offer my sincerest of apologies for acting on my own.

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:04.730
But I vow that I, Kaisar, have done nothing
to betray you, My Lord.

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:12.360
Very well.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:14.530
In light of your performance tonight,

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:17.030
I shall give you the benefit of the doubt.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.280
Thank you, My Lord.

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:30.840
That man is a terrible liar.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:04.460
You saved me yesterday.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.460
Promise not to tell anybody about yesterday!

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.920
About how you can turn
into a dragon?

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:14.050
No, not that!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.890
That I turn into a dragon

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:23.720
whenever a guy makes my heart race.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.940
I'm weird, right?

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:31.020
I know it's weird.

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:33.030
But I can't do anything about it.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.030
I...

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:42.160
I'm from a small village way out to the east of here.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.500
My father is a dragon,

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.000
and my mother is a human.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:52.960
I'm not sure if that's why.

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:57.930
But I was the worst
at turning into a dragon in the village.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:11.520
You suck!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:14.230
You suck, Nina!

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.400
But then one day

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:21.200
when I got close to a young man in the village...

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.040
Hey, you all right?

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:56.230
I ended up causing a lot of damage to the village,

00:15:56.400 --> 00:16:01.700
so my mother lectured me to avoid young men.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:08.290
It was fine since most of the villagers were old.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:10.210
But after coming to the capital--

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:12.080
you met me.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.500
I mean, you're not the only one who made my heart race.

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:22.130
I don't remember anything when I turn into a dragon
and go wild.

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:25.550
And there's nothing I can do about it.

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:29.270
I think if I turned to look at you right now,

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.850
I'd probably turn into a dragon again.

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:35.360
That would be a problem.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:37.980
I'm so messed up

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:41.740
that I don't think I'll be any use to you or the demons.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.280
That's not true.

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:49.200
If you're unable to control yourself,

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:50.870
I will control you instead.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.420
What do you mean?

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:58.210
Let me make love to you

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:00.210
and turn you into a dragon!

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.420
What?

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:06.600
What are you saying?

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:10.640
If you don't stop saying weird things like that,

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:15.100
I really will turn into a dragon!

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.820
Not now, please.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:23.990
Anyway, don't tell anybody about this, okay?

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.870
Nina!

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:49.680
Did you mess with Nina again,
you pervert?

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:52.020
What are you talking about?

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:55.190
She just ran out of here looking like
she was about to cry.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.350
Not my fault.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.230
She just ran out in the middle of our conversation.

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.530
If you hurt her

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:03.400
or drag her into something dangerous,

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:06.530
I'll never treat you again.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:09.660
Hey, stop! You'll reopen your wounds.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.870
Seriously?

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:17.830
Stay here with them.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:20.590
What are you doing?

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:22.750
I'm going to disappear for a while.

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:24.460
I can't take him with me.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.300
That's no reason to leave him with me.

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:28.930
Don't follow me!

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.390
Got it?

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:31.970
Seriously?

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:01.290
Is it just me, or are you looking worn-out?

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.710
So?

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:09.970
Are you ready to help me conquer
the demons and battle the gods?

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.850
If we join forces,

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:17.930
we will be able to create a world
fit for mankind more quickly.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:24.900
You don't seem ready to give me the answer I want.

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:26.990
That is unfortunate.

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:34.200
By the way, it seems that your child is still alive.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:40.000
It was quite smart of you to hide him
with the demon slaves.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:45.210
Selling your own child off into slavery--

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:49.380
you're quite a brute of a mother.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.550
Though I will kill him in the end,

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:57.890
I will allow you to see him once before then.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:02.810
I will be back when that time comes.

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:07.190
Saint Jeanne D'Arc.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.160
Lord Michael.

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:26.420
Mugaro, are you feeling sad?

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:32.090
I wonder where Azazel went.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.890
Don't worry.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:40.600
I'm sure he'll come back soon.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:51.150
Firestarter

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:04.210
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:08.250
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:12.090
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:16.430
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:18.930
So fragile
Yet strong

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:21.060
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:25.020
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:29.400
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:33.400
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:42.120
Let's end it all today
I'm done living this pointless life

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:51.380
Let's end it all today
I've taken my last pointless breath

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:55.180
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:59.640
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:04.480
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:11.440
A new morning is coming

00:22:56.110 --> 00:22:58.070
Don't move.

00:23:01.410 --> 00:23:06.160
Do you have any idea who you're dealing with here?

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:09.870
You're...

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:12.130
Lord Azazel!

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:15.590
What are you doing here, coward?

00:23:16.170 --> 00:23:18.430
You turned down our invitation

00:23:18.590 --> 00:23:21.300
and became a slave to the humans.

00:23:21.470 --> 00:23:23.600
So what do you want with us now?

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:28.730
I'm the bounty being called the Rag Demon.

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:33.110
I will bring down the humans

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.110
and take back the pride the demons have lost.

00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:44.620
The time has come.

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:48.250
Nina, what's wrong?

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:51.330
Rita! My teacher told me
this preview section is done so carelessly.

00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:54.130
Well, I think he'll believe so
even more after this.

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:57.760
Next time on Rage of Bahamut: Virgin Soul,

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:00.050
"Those Who Won't Give Up"

00:24:00.260 --> 00:24:01.130
Oh, you were right.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:03.970
Baha Baha Soul!!

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:07.220
Baha Baha Baha soul.

00:24:08.180 --> 00:24:10.560
You'll watch next time too, right?
